    "updated_at": "2025-03-12T15:38:21Z",
    "body": "I vote for legacy uncomposed range. \"Uncomposed\" is very clear, and I think \"legacy\" is important to keep in the name as a good hint for web platform designers, for the reasons @annevk mentioned. @dizhang168, since nobody disagrees with \"legacy uncomposed range\", do you want to incorporate this change into your PR?",
